  pages:
  - heading: Be careful...
    body: 'Santiago,


      I heard you and Francisco got into it again. Whatever
      he said, stay away from him for a few days. Daisy and the kids don''t need
      the two of you making things worse.


      I know you''re angry but please
      call me before you do something stupid


      Beto'
  - heading: Fuck off
    body: 'You seriously need to stop treating Daisy like she can''t make her own
      decisions. She talks to me because she wants to


      F'
  - heading: Bell Components
    body: 'Hello Santiago,


      We can manufacture another reset assemble mechanism.
      If you still want us to proceed, confirm the dimensions from your previous
      order.


      Regards,

      Bell Components'
  - heading: From You (yes, you)
    body: 'May 31st


      Hi myself,


      Hey, so on May 20th somenthing happens.
      You really REALLY don''t wanna know what it is. Trust me. Just keep turning
      it back; just do it.


      You, from the future'
  description: 
  detectiveLine: Seems this is Santiago's email account
